---
const quotes = [
  {
    quote: 'We assign aftercare the moment treatment ends, and patients actually follow it, then they tell us so. For the first time, our follow-up feels like part of the care instead of admin.',
    name: 'Dr. Rachel Cohen',
    role: 'Northside Dental | 2 locations',
    initials: 'RC',
  },
  {
    quote: 'Patients open our app every day for their aftercare. Then they come back, and they bring their family. Retention stopped being a campaign and became a daily habit.',
    name: 'Dr. Marcus Tran',
    role: 'Bright Smile Studio',
    initials: 'MT',
  },
  {
    quote: 'The referral piece surprised me. A patient shares their points with a friend, the friend books, and everyone wins. It is word of mouth, finally on rails.',
    name: 'Dr. Priya Nair',
    role: 'Cedar Park Ortho | 4 locations',
    initials: 'PN',
  },
]
---
<section class="bg-cream-100 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-8xl px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-teal-700">Pilot practices</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,3rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.06] tracking-tight text-ink-900 text-balance">
        Dentists who turned aftercare into growth.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      {quotes.map((q) => (
        <figure class="flex flex-col card p-8 shadow-soft">
          <div class="flex gap-1 text-teal-500" aria-hidden="true">
            {Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (<span>★</span>))}
          </div>
          <blockquote class="mt-5 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-700">“{q.quote}”</blockquote>
          <figcaption class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-cream-200 pt-5">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-teal-100 font-heading text-sm font-semibold text-teal-800">{q.initials}</span>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900">{q.name}</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-ink-500">{q.role}</span>
            </span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
